    `calendar days to the last day to forward the claim`          IS `days from` (`the calendar date` 11 3 2026) `to` (`the calendar date` 18 3 2026)
    `calendar days to the last day to commence weekly payments`   IS `days from` (`the calendar date` 11 3 2026) `to` (`the calendar date` 19 3 2026)

